      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَلْمَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>whole</i> of a thing; (S, K;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُلْمَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَلَمَةٌ</span></b> . (K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَذْتُ الشَّىْءَ</span>
